<title>USA: Fluor Corp to issue $200 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Fluor Corp to issue $200 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour Corp is rumored to tap the corporate bond primary market with a $200 million debt offering this week, syndicate sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal, which is expected to consist of a 10-year maturity, will be underwritten by Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>(( --Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
</text>
